    "title": "Time to Think Flexibly About Learning",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "The Network of Teaching and Learning hosted the first of its seminar series on March 25, 2015. The seminar, \"Thinking Flexibly About Flexible Learning,\" was attended by 117 people from across AKU.",
