    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Network of Teaching and Learning hosted the first of its seminar series on March 25, 2015. The seminar, \"Thinking Flexibly About Flexible Learning,\" was led by Professor Susan Crichton, Director of Faculty of Education at the University of British Columbia, Okanagan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The seminar was attended by 117 participants from across AKU campuses, including Kabul."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Professor Crichton reminded the audience that information is NOT in short supply since the internet has been around for over 20 years and therefore, teaching and learning in higher education needs to explore pedagogical approaches that leverage the tools of our time. For more information please click here for the presentation or contact Jane Rarieya, Assistant Director, TL_net."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
